  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "Description": "MMC Access Control Registration (ACR) Module. Enrols a User: from the captured Face Object and Speech Object it produces the Face Descriptors (Entity Face Description) and Speech Descriptors (Entity Speech Description), each stamped with its acquisition time; Response and Scene Rendering speaks the confirmation. The User Name is the User Agent's own datum (typed): the UA writes the resulting descriptors and their times to Shared Storage under that name - the same gallery MMC-MAC reads to recognise. Entity Face/Speech Description read the Scene Descriptors from Shared Storage (not ports). Time (OSD-STM) accompanies each captured object from the UA clock. The UA drives this Module through the Controller; the Controller runs the sub-AIMs and routes data by data type per this L3.",

